      "10/16 update — 角色生成等太久\n\n背景：TTI server 無法回報進度；按 Cancel 不能退點（同一般 TTI）。\n\n1. 生成中：沿用 Create my character 生成畫面（skeleton＋屬性 chips＋Generating 按鈕），chips 下方加 This may take a moment. Keep this screen open.（不做假進度條；10/30 改：時間難預估，不寫具體時間）；左上 X 不 disable，按鈕下方加 Cancel\n2. Cancel：生成中下方一直有 Cancel，右上 X 相同。按下 → Stop and lose your credits?（沿用 §3.3 文案）。Leave anyway：停止、不退點；Keep Generating：繼續等。\n3. Timeout：生成 5 分鐘還沒好就跳 dialog\n   – Title：We couldn't create your character\n   – Body：This is taking longer than expected. Send us feedback and our support team will check your credits.\n   – Buttons：Close ／ Send Feedback（藍）\n   – Close：回到 Make your character 表單，輸入內容保留\n4. Send Feedback：開在 AI Issues tab，預填\n   – AI Feature Name：AI Mini Drama · Character generation\n   – What is the issue?：My character took too long to generate and didn't finish, but my credits were used. Please help me check. Time: {date & time}\n   – What Prompt did you use?：user 輸入的角色描述\n   – Email：有登入就預填\n   – Task ID 隱藏帶入（不顯示在表單上），送出時一起傳給 CS\n\n5. Finish your characters（一次補多個角色）同樣規則：\n   – 生成中標題：Creating {n} characters…；副標：This may take a moment. Keep this screen open.\n   – 左上 X 生成中不 disable；按鈕 Generating… 下方加 Cancel，兩者都跳 Stop and lose your credits?；Leave anyway：停止未完成的角色、不退點，已完成的保留\n   – 5 分鐘 timeout：We couldn't create your characters → Send Feedback（預填 issue 寫 {n} characters）\n   – 完成文案：Your characters are ready ／ Tap Confirm to continue.（取代「0 characters still need a look」）",
